                <li class="flex gap-2.5"><i class="ti ti-circle-check mt-0.5 text-base text-accent shrink-0"></i><span>Role-based review, revision history, and document validation.</span></li>
                <li class="flex gap-2.5"><i class="ti ti-circle-check mt-0.5 text-base text-accent shrink-0"></i><span>Payment tracking, meeting schedules, progress status, and reporting.</span></li>
              </ul>
              <p class="mt-4 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink/45">Technology stack</p>
              <div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
